1
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:28,940
Are you Mr. Li?

2
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:30,080
Thanks.

3
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,980
Enjoy your meal.

4
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:31,820
I'll take this, then.

5
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:32,360
Okay.

6
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,780
The task force cast a tight dragnet,

7
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:45,140
closing in step by step.

8
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:48,300
Du Qingbo resorted to covert tactics,

9
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,260
creating hurdles at every turn

10
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:50,820
to obstruct the task force.

11
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:53,780
As the battle between good and evil peaked,

12
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,720
no one could have anticipated

13
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,420
that a single expert

14
00:00:58,060 --> 00:01:00,660
would turn the tide completely.

15
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,320
Professor?

16
00:01:07,260 --> 00:01:07,820
Professor.

17
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:10,780
I left the engineering materials report on your desk.

18
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:26,740
Xiao Wang,

19
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:30,480
you should take this money back.

20
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:32,680
I looked it up online.

21
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:35,460
A bribe of 300,000 is considered a huge amount.

22
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,320
In severe cases,

23
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,280
it can mean up to three years in prison.

24
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:40,400
So,

25
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:41,920
you'd better take it back.

26
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,080
Brother Zhang,

27
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:48,600
he wants to return the money.

28
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:01,760
What's the matter, Professor Gong?

29
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:03,860
Not enough money?

30
00:02:04,180 --> 00:02:04,820
No...

31
00:02:04,820 --> 00:02:05,940
Or do you want something else?

32
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:08,260
This money...

33
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:09,840
I really can't take it.

34
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:14,180
Don't worry.

35
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:16,700
I won't say a word to anyone.

36
00:02:22,940 --> 00:02:24,540
Am I being too nice to you?

37
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:27,140
Am I being too nice to you?

38
00:02:28,920 --> 00:02:30,920
I call you "Professor" out of respect,

39
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,880
and you actually think you're somebody?

40
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,900
Take the respect when it's given.

41
00:02:38,380 --> 00:02:41,220
Otherwise, don't even think about surviving in Jianzhou.

42
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,260
Take the money

43
00:02:44,460 --> 00:02:45,340
and get the hell out.

44
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,200
Be good.

45
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,400
Do as you're told.

46
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:13,300
Everything all right at the company?

47
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:18,200
An expert was uncooperative and wanted to return the money.

48
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:19,300
Who?

49
00:03:19,780 --> 00:03:21,300
Named Gong.

50
00:03:22,940 --> 00:03:24,240
Gong Jianlin.

51
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,220
But after my

52
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:28,860
care and guidance,

53
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,320
he came around.

54
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,740
Don't worry, it's taken care of.

55
00:03:33,740 --> 00:03:34,400
All right.

56
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,540
Got it.

57
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,520
You can go now.

58
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:06,840
Hello?

59
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:07,700
Hello.

60
00:04:07,940 --> 00:04:09,360
Is this Comrade Gong Jianlin?

61
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:11,200
Speaking.

62
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,020
I'm with the Municipal Discipline and Inspection Committee.

63
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,120
We need to ask you about a few things.

64
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,420
Please come tomorrow at 2:00 PM

65
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:17,960
to Conference Room 3 at the Discipline and Inspection Committee.

66
00:04:18,620 --> 00:04:19,740
All right, sure.

67
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:24,120
Who is it?

68
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:34,800
What are you up to, Professor Gong?

69
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,400
I've been knocking forever.

70
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,780
Over that little bit of money,

71
00:04:39,780 --> 00:04:41,020
you're not planning to report me, are you?

72
00:04:42,140 --> 00:04:44,220
What are you talking about? Are you joking?

73
00:04:44,340 --> 00:04:45,500
Of course not.

74
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,120
C-Come in, have a seat.

75
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,560
Professor Gong.

76
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,680
Mr. Du.

77
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,880
Aren't you going to invite me in?

78
00:04:59,080 --> 00:04:59,560
Come in.

79
00:04:59,740 --> 00:05:00,420
Please.

80
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,140
Professor Gong,

81
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,980
I heard

82
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,820
you don't want to work with us anymore.

83
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,640
That can't be true, can it?

84
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:13,240
It's a misunderstanding.

85
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,440
Not at all.

86
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,040
Here, please.

87
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,400
Have some water, Mr. Du.

88
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:18,200
That's what I thought.

89
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:22,540
You know,

90
00:05:22,740 --> 00:05:24,180
a while back,

91
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,880
I came across a video.

92
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:27,600
There was someone in it

93
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,360
who looked exactly like you.

94
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,360
Take a look and see if it's you.

95
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:32,920
Here, show it to the professor.

96
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:34,160
Come on.

97
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:37,260
Let's watch it together.

98
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,440
Here.

99
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,280
"Stop it, Professor Gong."

100
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,080
You...

101
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:47,960
Look.

102
00:05:48,380 --> 00:05:49,520
It really is you.

103
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:50,320
Take a look.

104
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:54,340
Professor Gong,

105
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,320
a man of your standing...

106
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,680
there are certain things you just shouldn't do.

107
00:05:59,300 --> 00:05:59,760
Wait, no...

108
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:00,820
If your family and employer found out,

109
00:06:00,820 --> 00:06:02,040
it would look terrible.

110
00:06:02,540 --> 00:06:03,720
You set me up!

111
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:06,000
Why are you setting me up? Why?!

112
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,280
So what if we did?

113
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,680
Don't terrify Professor Gong.

114
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:16,340
Professor Gong,

115
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:19,440
you need to have faith in Jinxin.

116
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,620
Look at Jinxin Company.

117
00:06:21,620 --> 00:06:23,040
Have we ever had any trouble all these years?

118
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:23,900
Never.

119
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,280
Why?

120
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:27,100
Because we run a legitimate business.

121
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,540
Plus, I have plenty of friends.

122
00:06:29,460 --> 00:06:31,200
I even have friends in the Discipline and Inspection Committee.

123
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:32,460
The...

124
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,400
The Discipline and Inspection Committee?

125
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,700
The Discipline and Inspection Committee.

126
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,960
Did they contact you?

127
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:46,920
No, Mr. Du...

128
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,820
They did contact me,

129
00:06:49,280 --> 00:06:50,880
but I swear I didn't say anything!

130
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,320
Believe me.

131
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,800
I really didn't say anything!

132
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,660
You...

133
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:56,180
Mr. Du!

134
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,520
I didn't say anything!

135
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,820
Not a single word!

136
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,820
Tell you what, Professor Gong.

137
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,480
Why don't you

138
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,440
go unwind with Zhang Lei for a few days?

139
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,480
Get some rest.

140
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,360
Let's go.

141
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,040
Professor Gong.

142
00:07:11,460 --> 00:07:11,920
Wait, Mr. Du...

143
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:13,540
Let's go have some more fun.

144
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,520
I really didn't say anything, Mr. Du!

145
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:16,800
I really didn't, Mr. Du!

146
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,480
Let's go.

147
00:07:23,660 --> 00:07:24,680
Qingbo!

148
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,820
Qingbo!

149
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,280
What's wrong?

150
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,920
Did you have a nightmare again?

151
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:06,680
Get ready to leave the country early.

152
00:08:07,240 --> 00:08:08,800
I've already sorted out the paperwork.

153
00:08:09,380 --> 00:08:11,140
Take Yanyan with you.

154
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:20,120
A person has to know when to stop.

155
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:21,780
What about you?

156
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:28,840
I know what I'm doing.

157
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:47,340
The Discipline and Inspection Committee contacted me.

158
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:48,440
They—

159
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,680
They said they want to talk to me.

160
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,540
I think they must have

161
00:08:52,540 --> 00:08:54,040
gotten hold of some evidence.

162
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,840
If I come clean about everything now,

163
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,240
would it count as turning myself in?

164
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:00,400
Director He,

165
00:09:00,620 --> 00:09:01,920
how you feel right now,

166
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,520
I completely understand.

167
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:07,120
Everyone is trying to smooth things over right now.

168
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,680
Besides,

169
00:09:08,900 --> 00:09:10,200
our connections higher up

170
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,440
have pretty much been taken care of.

171
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,400
If you lose your nerve right now,

172
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,940
you'll only end up causing trouble.

173
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,480
But the Discipline and Inspection Committee is no joke!

174
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,120
Director He,

175
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,800
over the years,

176
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,740
how much has passed through your hands,

177
00:09:30,920 --> 00:09:32,620
you should know best.

178
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:41,340
You can't just get on and off this ship as you please.

179
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,040
If Young Master Qin finds out,

180
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,280
he won't be very happy.

181
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:52,280
All right, Mr. Du.

182
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:54,480
Director He is a smart man.

183
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:57,000
He knows how to weigh his options.

184
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,120
Right?

185
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,540
D-Don't worry.

186
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:06,260
I... I'll stick with everyone

187
00:10:06,940 --> 00:10:07,700
through thick and thin.
